---
import { url } from "../../lib/url";
import { FACTS } from "../../data/facts";
---

<!-- ===== 4. HIRING SOLUTIONS ===== -->
<section class="sec sec--soft" id="hiring">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cap-layout">
      <div class="cap-copy rv">
        <p class="eyebrow is-hire">Hiring Solutions</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px)">Great Hiring Starts With Deeper Understanding.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Hiring an executive is not a resume transaction.</p>
        <p class="lede">Before HSG recommends a candidate, we work to understand the organization, its leadership, expectations, culture, challenges, and what success in the position actually requires. Then we look beyond credentials to understand the person behind the resume.</p>

        <div class="netreach">
          <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3c2.6 2.4 4 5.6 4 9s-1.4 6.6-4 9c-2.6-2.4-4-5.6-4-9s1.4-6.6 4-9Z"/></svg>
          <p>Our reach is supported by approximately <b>{FACTS.partners}</b> partners throughout the <b>United States, Canada, England, and China</b>.</p>
        </div>

        <a class="btn" href={url("/find-talent/")} style="margin-top:10px">Find Talent <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="caps">
        <article class="cap rv" style="--d:1">
          <span class="cap-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.6-3.6"/></svg></span>
          <h4>Executive Search</h4>
          <p>Targeted searches for leadership and specialized talent.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cap rv" style="--d:2">
          <span class="cap-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19V9M9.5 19V5M15 19v-7M20.5 19v-4"/></svg></span>
          <h4>Candidate Assessment</h4>
          <p>Deeper evaluation of experience, leadership, communication, behavior, and alignment.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cap rv" style="--d:3">
          <span class="cap-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 0-3.2 6.4L21 20l-1.2-4.2A7.9 7.9 0 0 0 20 12Z"/><path d="M9 10.5h6M9 14h4"/></svg></span>
          <h4>Interviewing Support</h4>
          <p>Guidance before and during the interview process to help companies uncover what conventional interviews can miss.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cap rv" style="--d:4">
          <span class="cap-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 19c0-3 2.5-5.2 5.5-5.2s5.5 2.2 5.5 5.2"/><path d="M15 14.1c2.8-.3 5.5 1.6 5.5 4.9"/></svg></span>
          <h4>Collaborative Search<sup>®</sup></h4>
          <p>A collaborative approach that brings HSG and the client together throughout the search, evaluation, interview, and hiring decision.</p>
        </article>

        <!-- Private Vetting and Vetting Plus stay out of Hiring Solutions:
             Vetting Plus is a Career Solutions service (HSG 3-section update). -->
        <div class="also rv" style="--d:5; grid-column: 1 / -1">
          <span class="also-lbl">Also part of Hiring Solutions</span>
          <div class="chips" style="--c: var(--hiring); --wash: var(--hiring-soft)">
            <a class="chip" href={url("/find-talent/")}>Targeted Search</a>
            <a class="chip" href={url("/find-talent/")}>Confidential Search</a>
            <a class="chip" href={url("/find-talent/")}>Onboarding &amp; Retention Support</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>